{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NMonaQH51QN3nim11bUAAh","type":"tool_result","content":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/_project/report/eval_data_inventory_pooled_irt.md:**N=16 for MMLU/ARC, N=24 for GSM8K/HumanEval**\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/_project/report/eval_data_inventory_pooled_irt.md:**N=16 for MMLU/ARC, N=24 for GSM8K/HumanEval**\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/_project/report/eval_data_inventory_pooled_irt.md:**GSM8K** (N=24): all 8 × 0.5B + all 8 × 1.5B + all 8 × 3B (same list as MMLU + 8 × 0.5B)\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/_project/report/eval_data_inventory_pooled_irt.md:**HumanEval** (N=24): same as GSM8K\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T185145/worst/review_report.md:6. **(Moderate) Missing multidimensional IRT discussion.** Fitting unidimensional θ to MMLU (spanning diverse knowledge domains) is a clear simplification. Burnell et al. (2023) explores multidimensional IRT for LLMs. The paper does not discuss whether forced unidimensionality contributes to model misspecification and the coverage gap.\n/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T155040/median/review_report.md:1. **Single global γ_j per model is misspecified.** The paper's own results show benchmark-dependent effects: MMLU MAE=3.4pp but HumanEval MAE=5.6pp; γ at 100% dose varies across benchmarks (implicit in the per-benchmark MAE variation). A single γ_j forces the model to average across heterogeneous contamination effects. Per-benchmark or per-domain γ would be more appropriate and is a straightforward extension the paper does not explore or even discuss.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q6ktL2e5VZWNhgP4Qr4DGt","session_id":"8d6bae30-1865-4b12-ac9b-ecfe93d53670","uuid":"087c0f0b-72b7-4bcf-b10c-bab1ca083679","timestamp":"2026-05-16T10:58:51.512Z"}
